    <briefdescription>
<para>Provides optimized functions for integer power-of-two operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These functions perform efficient calculations for powers and divisions using bitwise operations, which are faster than standard multiplication or division when the exponent corresponds to powers of 2. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
